":0.34362140655517576,"y":0.24845542786007746,"h":0.014625967653683514},{"w":0.35390945434570309,"text":"you know that only 5% of airline pilots are women?","h":0.013239187996469615,"x":0.12962963640739533,"y":0.26301853488968752},{"text":"S:","x":0.094650205771814516,"w":0.018518518209457407,"y":0.27616279064990779,"h":0.01162790683971926},{"text":"That's terrible. Why is that?","y":0.27616279095074292,"w":0.18930040359497069,"h":0.013081394879037367,"x":0.12962963122720605},{"h":0.021042878503622631,"y":0.28637770755960612,"text":"M: I'm not sure. The 'experience \/ overtime \/ training","w":0.37933906555175778,"x":0.09640294375838146},{"w":0.32961185455322262,"h":0.016200640510902531,"x":0.12940587812453294,"text":"is long and very expensive, but it's the same for","y":0.30357610902308885},{"x":0.12962962199676067,"w":0.34362140655517581,"y":0.31818181826720737,"h":0.013239187996469615,"text":"men and women. Maybe women think it's a man's"},{"text":"job, so they don't apply for the training","x":0.12551440760810756,"y":0.3327449250786797,"h":0.013239187996469615,"w":0.275720157623291},{"h":0.010174417958676241,"x":0.092592593021494848,"y":0.34738372119871419,"w":0.02057613134384155,"text":"S:"},{"x":0.11316872017674932,"y":0.34730803197493887,"w":0.34979423522949216,"text":"If I wanted to be an airline pilot, would I find the","h":0.013239187996469504},{"x":0.12757201825370207,"text":"training difficult?","y":0.36187113849284347,"w":0.11934156417846678,"h":0.01167537296965182},{"y":0.37476348722636987,"h":0.015266955477520106,"w":0.36237583160400388,"text":"M: No, I don't think so. In fact, I think you have the","x":0.094522853562414189},{"h":0.01470807034255972,"y":0.38790820850453467,"text":"right 'salary \/ qualities \/ colleagues.","w":0.24485595703125002,"x":0.12757201863801021},{"text":"S: Really?","w":0.08436213493347168,"x":0.094650209307955493,"y":0.40406976740136136,"h":0.011640735568983374},{"x":0.094457666011327851,"h":0.016237358234671539,"y":0.41679475071326044,"text":"M: Yes, you're healthy and you have excellent eyesight.","w":0.38719917297363282},{"h":0.013239187996469504,"text":"You're intelligent, you're good at Maths and","w":0.30658435821533203,"y":0.43159752877862045,"x":0.12551440832031743},{"w":0.33333332061767573,"x":0.12757202837428952,"text":"Science, and you get on well with people. If you","y":0.44616063558403662,"h":0.013239187996469504},{"w":0.35596706390380856,"y":0.46072374223441392,"text":"got your university *experience \/ overtime \/ degree","x":0.12551440950900106,"h":0.013239187996469504},{"y":0.47355492081275496,"h":0.015825784216911831,"w":0.33782997131347658,"text":"first, and then went to pilot school, you could be","x":0.12530226795870283},{"text":"a great pilot.","w":0.09073894500732424,"h":0.012446906013185766,"y":0.48796259330566194,"x":0.12541242111416884},{"w":0.016460905075073237,"text":"S:","x":0.092592593004301518,"y":0.50290697685233632,"h":0.0087209299193582446},{"h":0.011656129875755483,"x":0.1111111126015998,"w":0.17901233673095707,"text":"Do you enjoy your job?","y":0.50290697681269847},{"w":0.36213989257812501,"x":0.09053498594687738,"h":0.011684352911791707,"text":"M: Ilove it.I work long hours, but there are lots of","y":0.51744186053362873},{"text":"good things about my job. For instance, I can","x":0.12345679553645873,"h":0.013239187996469615,"w":0.31687242507934571,"y":0.53045013244222383},{"y":0.54633715806061056,"w":0.28395061492919921,"h":0.010348888592497052,"x":0.12345678846132635,"text":"travel anywhere in the world for free. (...)"},{"w":0.018518518209457407,"h":0.010174418800401153,"text":"S:","x":0.088477366594859774,"y":0.55959302311433434},{"h":0.013239187996469504,"text":"What about your colleagues \/ salary \/ overtime?","w":0.33950614929199219,"x":0.12345680614104083,"y":0.55957634588348248},{"x":0.090351186282704998,"w":0.37073562622070311,"y":0.57232513374433858,"text":"M: I work with some great people - we have a really","h":0.015362221060447268},{"x":0.1234567990477636,"h":0.01162790683971926,"text":"good time together. (...)","w":0.17078187942504883,"y":0.58866279069351235},{"y":0.60174418613043723,"w":0.016460905075073237,"x":0.09053497976699014,"h":0.0087209299193582446,"text":"S:"},{"text":"Is it easy to become a captain and get a pay rise?","w":0.36213989257812501,"y":0.60319767443866756,"x":0.1049382781279473,"h":0.011627906839719149},{"x":0.090385049702482401,"y":0.61455149255316399,"w":0.35211013793945312,"text":"M: No, you need a lot of •bonuses \/ experience \/","h":0.015288466599170603},{"text":"salary. I've only been doing this job for five years.","w":0.3415637588500976,"x":0.12345680797207041,"y":0.63062665476288093,"h":0.013268693821259725},{"x":0.11934158256928022,"h":0.013240470785223502,"text":"1 may become captain after another ten years.","y":0.64518976175603926,"w":0.3209876251220703},{"x":0.073971671820084448,"h":0.013320509985497053,"text":"2 Complete the sentences with the words from the box.","y":0.68455622661737436,"w":0.41788574218749996},{"x":0.096448635183089521,"text":"There are two extra words.","y":0.69785728644838296,"w":0.20018449783325196,"h":0.014442819256963557},{"y":0.7252906978548127,"x":0.11522634003964015,"h":0.013081394879037256,"text":"colleagues degree experience","w":0.23868312835693356},{"w":0.065843620300293004,"h":0.0087209299193582446,"text":"overtime","x":0.36625514348497012,"y":0.72819767467210383},{"x":0.11522633942617513,"y":0.73837209304013252,"w":0.076131682395935069,"h":0.013081394879037256,"text":"profession"},{"h":0.011627906839719149,"x":0.19547325334122279,"y":0.73982558156076061,"w":0.08024690628051756,"text":"qualities"},{"x":0.27756325901664602,"h":0.013191338460843083,"y":0.74080451340223052,"text":"salary training","w":0.11571789741516114},{"h":0.013273824976275495,"x":0.11934157171628339,"w":0.35185184478759768,"text":"Dog training helps your pet behave better and can","y":0.76434245380408616},{"x":0.11728394692843729,"h":0.01323918799646961